# The client clock for stream_ollama_reasoning.sse, one millisecond offset
# per data event, in order. The .sse half is the wire capture itself
# (Ollama 0.34.2, qwen3:1.7b, 2026-09-21); the capture kept the bytes and
# not the clock, so these arrivals are a plausible client timeline attached
# for the timing assertions — a 37-token prompt prefilled in ~0.6 s and 46
# thinking deltas at ~45 tok/s. Only the shape is load-bearing: the first
# reasoning delta's arrival must be the TTFT, and the span from it to the
# last one must be a real decode window. Nothing here is a measured figure
# and no test asserts these numbers as ones the server produced.
#
